  "translation": "Yehuw (Yehu), Hanani denkɛ, min ye ɲɛdɔnniyabaga ye, bɔra ka kɛ a ɲɛma, k'a fɔ Yehoshafat masakɛ ma ko: yala i bɛ dɛnniyabaw dɛmɛ, ani i bɛ Yawe sirannabagaw ka kanuya don wa? Ani o la, sunbɛ b'i kan, Yawe ɲɛ fɛ.",
